  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      613.99,
      286.7,
      725.84
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land to be Acquired:- Following allotments of lands depicted in Sheet No. 09 in Additional No. 10 of Final Village Survey Plan No. 176, prepared by Senior Survey Superintendent of Matara District, situated in the village of Kebiliyapola South, in Grama Niladhari\u2019s Division No. 284A, Minor Division of Kandabada Pattu East in Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Hakmana, Matara District, Southern Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      416.72,
      539.43,
      501.44
    ],
    "text": "1. Lot No. 273 Name of the land: Godamabewela Bogahahena; Original Claimant: K. M. Siyadoris,Welegedara, Kebiliyapola, South Hakmana; Extent: 0.0114 Hectare. Boundaries : North : Lot Nos. 113 and 89; East: Lot Nos. 89 and 113; South: Lot No. 113; West: Lot Nos. 113 and 114.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      502.88,
      539.4,
      739.8
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat of Hakmana on the 23rd day of October 2019, at 10.00 a.m and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 16th day of October 2019, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation, for the Acquisition of the said land/servitude the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. KUSALAKA NANAYAKKARA, Divisional Secretary, Hakmana. 21st day of August, 2019. Divisional Secretariat, 09 - 247",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
